2026-01-31 17:23:12 | OUTPUT |     • 背書 (Guarantee/Endorsement): Financial responsibility, potential for loss if the loan defaults, implying trust but also a degree of desperation.
2026-01-31 17:23:12 | OUTPUT |     • 連帶保證 (Joint and Several Guarantee): Full responsibility for the debt, maximum risk exposure, highlighting the weight of the commitment.
