2026-01-31 17:23:12 | OUTPUT |     • 兄弟公司 (Brother Company): Familial business relationships, potentially overlooking due diligence in favor of loyalty, subjective evaluation vs. objective financial health.
2026-01-31 17:23:12 | OUTPUT |     • 聯貸 (Syndicated Loan): Large loan amount, banks involved scrutinizing the borrower, usually used for significant projects/expansion, potential signal of ambition or overreach.
